  {
   "t": "text",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 664,
   "w": 966,
   "h": 56,
   "html": "<h3>To align with our final deliverable, we need to integrate the AI-stylized output into the texture. I&#39;ll integrate the grape hyacinth texture using Itim&#39;s AI tool.</h3>",
