   "w": 966,
   "h": 112,
   "html": "<h3>According to Yiyi&#39;s research with Itim, we found a way to make the grape hyacinth texture more stylized. We started with a manually painted texture in Substance Painter, and then Itim ran the texture through her tool. I then reassigned the texture to the grape hyacinth and painted over it to enhance its brushstroke feel. Finally, we got the stylized texture.</h3>",
   "plain": "According to Yiyi&#39;s research with Itim, we found a way to make the grape hya",
